title: Start
---
<<declare $TalkedToHorse = false>>
<<declare $AmountofFriendsFound = 0>>
<<declare $AmountofFriendsEaten = 0>>
===
title: Horse
---
<<AnimalNoise QuestGiver>>
<<if ($TalkedToHorse == true && $AmountofFriendsFound + $AmountofFriendsEaten < 5)>>
    Horse: It seems you haven't found all my friends yet.
    Horse: Come back to me when you've found them all!
    Horse: We don't want anyone to feel left out!
<<elseif ($TalkedToHorse == true && $AmountofFriendsFound + $AmountofFriendsEaten == 5)>>
    <<if ($AmountofFriendsFound == 5)>>
    Horse: Wow you found all of my friends! Thank you soo much!
    Horse: Now we can finnaly start the party!
    Horse: I just don't have enough cake for the new human friend...
    Horse: Sorry dude...
    <<FoundAllFriends -GameManager->>
    <<elseif ($AmountofFriendsEaten == 5)>>
    Horse: I think I heard some screaming in the forest...
    Horse: Where did all my friends go?
    Horse: And why do you look so hungry?
    <<AteAllFriends -GameManager->>
    <<elseif ($AmountofFriendsEaten > 3)>>
    Horse: Where most of my friends?
    Horse: Wait?
    Horse: You said you don't more another piece of cake?
    Horse: Alright I guess...
    <<AteMostFriends -GameManager->>
    <<elseif ($AmountofFriendsFound > 3)>>
    Horse: Yay most of my friends are here!
    Horse: I am missing some people tho...
    Horse: I guess they didn't make it...
    Horse: More cake for us I guess!!!
    <<FoundMostFriends -GameManager->>
    <<endif>>
    
<<else>>
    Horse: Hello random person I just met!
    Horse: I invited my friends to a party but they seem to have gotten lost.
    Horse: Could you go find and bring them to me?
    -> Sure!
        Horse: Thanks alot!
        Horse: I'll make sure to save a slice of cake for you!
    -> No?
        Horse: You think you have a choice?!?
        Horse: Bold of you to assume that buddy!
        Horse: Now you better get my friends before I do something I'll regret!

    <<set $TalkedToHorse = true>>
<<endif>>

<<StopInteracting QuestGiver>>
===
title: Dog
---
<<AnimalNoise Dog>>
Dog: Hello random person I just met!
Dog: Are you helping me find horse?
Dog: Thanks alot human!
Dog: You look a bit hungry tho?
Dog: Are you sure you're ok?

-> Eat the dog
    <<Eaten Dog>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsEaten += 1>>
-> Yeah I'm ok!
    Dog: Alright!
    Dog: Lets go!
    <<AnimalNoise Dog>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsFound += 1>>

<<collect Dog>>
<<StopInteracting Dog>>
===
title: Kitty
---
<<AnimalNoise Kitty>>
Kitty: Hello random person I just met!
Kitty: Wow you're big!
Kitty: Can you help me find my friend Horse?
Kitty: I lost the way to find him.
<<wait 1>>
Kitty: You seem kinda hungry human?

-> Eat the Kitty
    <<Eaten Kitty>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsEaten += 1>>
-> I'm fine, lets bring you to Horse.
    Kitty: Thanks alot human!
    Kitty: Lets Become good friends!
    <<AnimalNoise Kitty>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsFound += 1>>

<<collect Kitty>>
<<StopInteracting Kitty>>
===
title: Chicken
---
<<AnimalNoise Chicken>>
Chicken: Hello random person I just met!
Chicken: You seem afully hungry?
Chicken: Anyways!
Chicken: I seem to have lost my way while trying to reach Horse.
Chicken: Could you perhaps help me find him human?

-> Eat the Chicken
    <<Eaten Chicken>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsEaten += 1>>
-> Horse told me to bring you so lets go!
    Chicken: Thanks alot human.
    Chicken: You have my gratitude.
    <<AnimalNoise Chicken>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsFound += 1>>

<<collect Chicken>>
<<StopInteracting Chicken>>
===
title: Penguin
---
<<AnimalNoise Penguin>>
Penguin: Hello random person I just met!
Penguin: are you alright? You look starved?
Penguin: Ahh I know, Horse should have some food left over!
Penguin: If you could help me find him I'm sure we can get you something to eat!

-> Eat the Penguin
    <<Eaten Penguin>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsEaten += 1>>
-> Horse told me to find you anyways so that works out.
    Penguin: Great!
    Penguin: Lets go human!
    <<AnimalNoise Penguin>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsFound += 1>>

<<collect Penguin>>
<<StopInteracting Penguin>>
===
title: Tiger
---
<<AnimalNoise Tiger>>
Tiger: Hello random person I just met!
Tiger: You look like you could eat a horse!
Tiger: I'm joking ofcourse!
Tiger: But talking about horses...
Tiger: I seem to have lost my way.
Tiger: Could you help me find my friend Horse?

-> Eat the Tiger
    <<Eaten Kitty>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsEaten += 1>>
-> Horse told me to find you so that works out great!
    Tiger: Thanks alot human!
    Tiger: Lets go then!
    <<AnimalNoise Tiger>>
    <<set $AmountofFriendsFound += 1>>

<<collect Tiger>>
<<StopInteracting Tiger>>
===
